<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Echo Noise"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="エコーノイズ"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="KAF"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="kaf"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="かふ"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="花譜"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="花谱"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Transcendent Love"/><amll:meta key="album" value="深愛"/><amll:meta key="album" value="深爱"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPB602601135"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3383669224"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="0043gWvG3cj5Jm"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="667146773"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="1XywFYsONTNbSWCJNuQOXt"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="6764277444"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="174598250"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ASyunagi"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:03.150"><div begin="10.910" end="3:03.150"><p begin="10.910" end="15.900" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="10.910" end="11.280">誰</span><span begin="11.280" end="11.490">だ</span><span begin="11.490" end="11.610">っ</span><span begin="11.610" end="11.780">て</span><span begin="11.780" end="12.140">自</span><span begin="12.140" end="12.510">分</span><span begin="12.510" end="13.110">が</span><span begin="13.110" end="13.300">主</span><span begin="13.300" end="13.630">人</span><span begin="13.630" end="14.010">公</span><span begin="14.010" end="14.330">の</span><span begin="14.330" end="14.700">世</span><span begin="14.700" end="15.070">界</span><span begin="15.070" end="15.900">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论是谁 都理应生活在自己是主角的世界里</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">無論是誰 都理應生活在自己是主角的世界裡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">In a world where everyone is their own protagonist</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">누구나 자신이 주인공인 세계에서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tout le monde est censé vivre dans un monde où il est le protagoniste n&apos;est-ce pas ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cualquiera en un mundo donde es el protagonista</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">In einer Welt in der jeder selbst der Protagonist ist</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Qualquer um em um mundo onde é o próprio protagonista</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ведь каждый должен жить в мире где он главный герой не так ли</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">In un mondo in cui ognuno è il protagonista</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dare datte jibun ga shujinkou no sekai de</span></p><p begin="16.350" end="18.370" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.350" end="16.430">生</span><span begin="16.540" end="16.720">き</span><span begin="16.720" end="16.920">て</span><span begin="16.920" end="17.070">い</span><span begin="17.070" end="17.220">る</span><span begin="17.220" end="17.440">は</span><span begin="17.440" end="17.580">ず</span><span begin="17.580" end="17.750">だ</span><span begin="17.750" end="17.880">よ</span><span begin="18.000" end="18.340">ね</span><span begin="18.340" end="18.370">？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样生活着的对吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這樣生活著的對吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">We are supposed to be living right?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">살아가고 있는 거겠지?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu vis bien de cette façon n&apos;est-ce pas ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿Se supone que está viviendo verdad?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sollte man doch leben oder?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Deveria estar vivendo não é?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Должен же</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tutti dovrebbero vivere vero</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ikite iru hazu da yo ne?</span></p><p begin="18.590" end="21.730" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.590" end="18.670">わ</span><span begin="18.760" end="18.910">た</span><span begin="18.910" end="19.110">し</span><span begin="19.110" end="19.450">は</span><span begin="19.450" end="19.760">確</span><span begin="19.760" end="20.140">信</span><span begin="20.140" end="20.370">持</span><span begin="20.480" end="20.840">て</span><span begin="20.840" end="21.370">な</span><span begin="21.370" end="21.510">い</span><span begin="21.510" end="21.730">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我却无法确信哦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我卻無法確信哦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I cannot hold onto that certainty</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나는 확신할 수 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je n&apos;en suis pas certaine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Yo no puedo estar segura de eso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich kann mir da nicht sicher sein</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu não consigo ter certeza</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Но я не могу быть в этом уверена</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Io non ne ho la certezza</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Watashi wa kakushin motenai yo</span></p><p begin="22.030" end="27.220" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.030" end="22.560">朝</span><span begin="22.560" end="22.710">目</span><span begin="22.710" end="22.850">が</span><span begin="22.850" end="23.070">覚</span><span begin="23.070" end="23.220">め</span><span begin="23.220" end="23.320">る</span><span begin="23.420" end="23.820">と</span><span begin="24.070" end="24.400">今日</span><span begin="24.400" end="24.560">は</span><span begin="24.560" end="24.740">い</span><span begin="24.740" end="24.920">つ</span><span begin="24.920" end="25.110">だ</span><span begin="25.110" end="25.260">っ</span><span begin="25.260" end="25.470">け</span><span begin="25.470" end="25.610">っ</span><span begin="25.610" end="25.930">て</span><span begin="25.930" end="26.300">曖</span><span begin="26.300" end="26.970">昧</span><span begin="26.970" end="27.220">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">晨间醒来时 连今天是什么日子都变得模糊不清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">晨間醒來時 連今天是什麼日子都變得模糊不清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">When I wake up in the morning it&apos;s ambiguous what day it is today</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아침에 눈을 뜨면 오늘이 언제였더라 하며 모호해서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Quand je me réveille le matin je suis confuse en me demandant quel jour on est</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cuando me despierto en la mañana es ambiguo preguntándome qué día es hoy</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn ich morgens aufwache ist es vage welcher Tag heute ist</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quando acordo de manhã é ambíguo qual dia é hoje</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Просыпаясь утром я смутно соображаю какой сегодня день</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quando mi sveglio la mattina è tutto vago e mi chiedo che giorno sia oggi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Asa me ga sameru to kyou wa itsu dakke tte aimai de</span></p><p begin="27.470" end="33.360" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.470" end="28.000">一</span><span begin="28.000" end="28.240">人</span><span begin="28.340" end="28.570">の</span><span begin="28.670" end="29.090">静</span><span begin="29.190" end="29.310">か</span><span begin="29.410" end="29.670">な</span><span begin="30.030" end="30.380">部屋</span><span begin="30.380" end="30.710">で</span><span begin="30.710" end="30.890">身</span><span begin="30.890" end="31.230">支</span><span begin="31.230" end="31.740">度</span> <span begin="32.220" end="32.400">繰</span><span begin="32.400" end="32.630">り</span><span begin="32.730" end="33.100">返</span><span begin="33.100" end="33.360">す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在一个人寂静的房间里 日复一日地梳洗打扮</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">在一個人寂靜的房間裡 日復一日地梳洗打扮</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Repeating my preparations alone in a quiet room</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">혼자 있는 고요한 방에서 채비를 반복해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Seule dans une chambre calme je me prépare encore et encore</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sola en una habitación tranquila repito mi arreglo personal</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mache mich im stillen Zimmer ganz allein bereit und wiederhole es</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Em um quarto silencioso sozinha me arrumo repetidamente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В тихой одинокой комнате я снова и снова собираюсь по делам</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ripeto i preparativi in una stanza silenziosa da sola</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hitori no shizuka na heya de mijitaku kurikaesu</span></p><p begin="38.530" end="40.860" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.530" end="38.770">ハ</span><span begin="38.770" end="38.890">イ</span><span begin="38.890" end="39.100">ウェ</span><span begin="39.100" end="39.230">イ</span><span begin="39.230" end="39.410">で</span><span begin="39.410" end="39.570">抜</span><span begin="39.570" end="39.720">け</span><span begin="39.720" end="39.900">る</span><span begin="39.900" end="40.240">高</span><span begin="40.240" end="40.580">層</span><span begin="40.580" end="40.860">群</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在高速公路上穿梭掠过的高楼林立间</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">在高速公路上穿梭掠過的高樓林立間</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">High-rises passing by on the highway</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">고속도로를 빠져나가는 고층 빌딩 숲</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Les gratte-ciel qui défilent sur l&apos;autoroute</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El grupo de rascacielos que paso en la autopista</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Hochhauskulisse an der ich auf dem Highway vorbeiziehe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Os arranha-céus que passo na rodovia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Высотки проносящиеся мимо на шоссе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">I grattacieli che sfrecciano sull&apos;autostrada</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Haiwei de nukeru kousougun</span></p><p begin="41.100" end="43.520" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.100" end="41.290">吸</span><span begin="41.290" end="41.440">い</span><span begin="41.440" end="41.610">込</span><span begin="41.610" end="41.770">ま</span><span begin="41.770" end="41.940">れ</span><span begin="41.940" end="42.200">な</span><span begin="42.200" end="42.280">い</span><span begin="42.280" end="42.630">よう</span><span begin="42.630" end="42.770">目</span><span begin="42.770" end="42.960">を</span><span begin="42.960" end="43.120">閉</span><span begin="43.120" end="43.300">じ</span><span begin="43.300" end="43.520">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了不被吞噬而闭上了双眼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">為了不被吞噬而閉上了雙眼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I closed my eyes so as not to be sucked in</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">빨려 들어가지 않으려고 눈을 감았어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J&apos;ai fermé les yeux pour ne pas être aspirée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cerré los ojos para no ser absorbida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich schloss die Augen um nicht aufgesogen zu werden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Fechei os olhos para não ser sugada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я закрыла глаза чтобы меня не засосало в них</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ho chiuso gli occhi per non esserne risucchiata</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Suikomarenai you me o tojita</span></p><p begin="43.850" end="49.050" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.850" end="43.990">い</span><span begin="43.990" end="44.170">つ</span><span begin="44.170" end="44.340">か</span><span begin="44.340" end="44.500">の</span><span begin="44.500" end="44.840">懐</span><span begin="44.840" end="45.010">か</span><span begin="45.010" end="45.200">し</span><span begin="45.200" end="45.370">い</span><span begin="45.370" end="45.710">愛</span><span begin="45.710" end="46.080">情</span><span begin="46.080" end="46.350">に</span><span begin="46.350" end="46.530">触</span><span begin="46.530" end="46.750">れ</span><span begin="46.750" end="47.090">た</span><span begin="47.890" end="47.980">気</span><span begin="48.080" end="48.400">が</span><span begin="48.540" end="48.680">し</span><span begin="48.790" end="49.050">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉仿佛触碰到了曾几何时那令人怀念的爱意</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">感覺彷彿觸碰到了曾幾何時那令人懷念的愛意</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I felt like I touched a nostalgic love from some time ago</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">언젠가의 그리운 애정에 닿은 듯한 기분이 들었어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J&apos;ai eu l&apos;impression de toucher à une affection nostalgique d&apos;autrefois</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sentí que toqué un afecto nostálgico de algún momento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich hatte das Gefühl eine nostalgische Liebe von irgendwann berührt zu haben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Senti ter tocado num afeto nostálgico de outrora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мне показалось что я коснулась той давней ностальгической любви</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mi è parso di sfiorare un affetto nostalgico di un tempo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Itsuka no natsukashii aijou ni fureta ki ga shita</span></p><p begin="49.440" end="52.450" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.440" end="49.610">記</span><span begin="49.610" end="49.950">憶</span><span begin="49.950" end="50.110">の</span><span begin="50.110" end="50.510">行</span><span begin="50.510" end="50.820">方</span><span begin="50.820" end="51.080">を</span><span begin="51.330" end="51.490">手</span><span begin="51.490" end="51.670">繰</span><span begin="51.670" end="51.820">り</span><span begin="51.820" end="51.990">寄</span><span begin="51.990" end="52.180">せ</span><span begin="52.180" end="52.450">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">循着记忆的去向不断摸索拉近</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">循著記憶的去向不斷摸索拉近</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Reeling in the whereabouts of my memories</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">기억의 행방을 끌어당겼어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J&apos;ai ramené à moi le fil de mes souvenirs</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tiré hacia mí del paradero de los recuerdos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich zog den Verbleib meiner Erinnerungen zu mir heran</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Puxei para mim o destino das memórias</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я притянула к себе обрывки ускользающих воспоминаний</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ho tirato a me le tracce dei ricordi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kioku no yukue o taguriyoseta</span></p><p begin="52.520" end="53.760" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.520" end="52.730">待</span><span begin="52.730" end="52.850">っ</span><span begin="52.850" end="52.990">て</span><span begin="52.990" end="53.190">い</span><span begin="53.190" end="53.350">て</span><span begin="53.350" end="53.760">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请等等我啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">請等等我啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Wait for me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">기다려 줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Attends-moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Espérame</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Warte auf mich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Espere</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Подожди же</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Aspetta</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Matte ite yo</span></p><p begin="54.050" end="56.520" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.050" end="54.240">消</span><span begin="54.240" end="54.570">え</span><span begin="54.570" end="54.760">な</span><span begin="54.760" end="54.910">い</span><span begin="54.910" end="55.120">で</span> <span begin="55.420" end="55.780">奪</span><span begin="55.780" end="55.940">わ</span><span begin="55.940" end="56.120">な</span><span begin="56.120" end="56.280">い</span><span begin="56.280" end="56.520">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请不要消失 不要夺走</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">請不要消失 不要奪走</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Don&apos;t disappear don&apos;t take it away</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">사라지지 마 빼앗지 마</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ne disparais pas ne me les vole pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No desaparezcas no me arrebates</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Verschwinde nicht raube sie nicht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não desapareça não as tire de mim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Не исчезай не отнимай</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non svanire non portarmeli via</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kienaide ubawanaide</span></p><p begin="56.760" end="1:00.320" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.760" end="56.870">わ</span><span begin="56.950" end="57.230">た</span><span begin="57.280" end="57.440">し</span><span begin="57.470" end="57.620">で</span><span begin="57.620" end="57.990">い</span><span begin="57.990" end="58.310">る</span><span begin="58.310" end="58.660">た</span><span begin="58.660" end="59.020">め</span><span begin="59.020" end="59.360">の</span><span begin="59.360" end="59.580">メ</span><span begin="59.690" end="1:00.040">モ</span><span begin="1:00.040" end="1:00.320">リー</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那些为了让我成为我而存在的记忆</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那些為了讓我成為我而存在的記憶</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The memory for me to remain myself</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나로서 존재하기 위한 기억</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Les souvenirs pour que je reste moi-même</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La memoria para seguir siendo yo misma</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Erinnerungen um ich selbst zu bleiben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">As memórias para eu continuar sendo eu mesma</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Те воспоминания благодаря которым я остаюсь собой</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">I ricordi che mi servono per essere me stessa</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Watashi de iru tame no memorii</span></p><p begin="1:00.360" end="1:01.970" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.360" end="1:00.680">正</span><span begin="1:00.680" end="1:00.850">し</span><span begin="1:00.850" end="1:01.040">さ</span><span begin="1:01.040" end="1:01.230">っ</span><span begin="1:01.230" end="1:01.400">て</span><span begin="1:01.400" end="1:01.560">も</span><span begin="1:01.560" end="1:01.750">の</span><span begin="1:01.750" end="1:01.970">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使将所谓的正确</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">即使將所謂的正確</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even if I dress myself up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">올바름이란 것을</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La chose qu&apos;on appelle la justesse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Incluso si me cubro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Selbst wenn man sich in</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vestir-se de algo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже если нарядиться</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche se mi rivesto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tadashisa tte mono o</span></p><p begin="1:02.250" end="1:04.690" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.250" end="1:02.410">着</span><span begin="1:02.410" end="1:02.630">込</span><span begin="1:02.630" end="1:02.760">ん</span><span begin="1:02.760" end="1:02.940">で</span><span begin="1:02.940" end="1:03.070">も</span><span begin="1:03.070" end="1:03.410">寂</span><span begin="1:03.410" end="1:03.740">しい</span><span begin="1:03.740" end="1:03.930">じゃ</span><span begin="1:03.930" end="1:04.110">な</span><span begin="1:04.110" end="1:04.280">い</span><span begin="1:04.280" end="1:04.690">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">披在身上 不还是会感到寂寞吗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">披在身上 不還是會感到寂寞嗎</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">In things like correctness isn&apos;t it lonely</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">껴입어봐도 외롭잖아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même si je m&apos;en revêts c&apos;est bien solitaire n&apos;est-ce pas ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Con eso llamado rectitud es solitario verdad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sogenannte Richtigkeit kleidet ist es doch einsam nicht wahr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Como a retidão também é solitário não é</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В так называемую правильность всё равно ведь одиноко</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Di ciò che è giusto non mi sento forse sola</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kikonde mo sabishii ja nai ka</span></p><p begin="1:04.950" end="1:09.270" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.950" end="1:05.060">わ</span><span begin="1:05.140" end="1:05.410">た</span><span begin="1:05.460" end="1:05.630">し</span><span begin="1:05.630" end="1:05.750">は</span><span begin="1:05.800" end="1:06.090">わ</span><span begin="1:06.170" end="1:06.390">た</span><span begin="1:06.470" end="1:06.750">し</span><span begin="1:06.860" end="1:07.080">の</span><span begin="1:07.190" end="1:07.550">た</span><span begin="1:07.550" end="1:07.860">め</span><span begin="1:07.860" end="1:08.210">に</span><span begin="1:08.210" end="1:09.190">歌</span><span begin="1:09.190" end="1:09.270">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是为了我自己而歌唱</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我是為了我自己而歌唱</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I sing for the sake of myself</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나는 나를 위해 노래해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je chante pour moi-même</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Yo canto para mí misma</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich singe für mich selbst</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu canto por mim mesma</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я буду петь ради самой себя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Io canto per me stessa</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Watashi wa watashi no tame ni utau</span></p><p begin="1:09.730" end="1:14.060" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.730" end="1:10.150">あ</span><span begin="1:10.150" end="1:10.540">ぁ</span><span begin="1:10.540" end="1:10.770">そ</span><span begin="1:10.770" end="1:10.940">れ</span><span begin="1:10.940" end="1:11.100">に</span><span begin="1:11.100" end="1:11.250">気</span><span begin="1:11.250" end="1:11.620">づ</span><span begin="1:11.620" end="1:11.820">い</span><span begin="1:11.970" end="1:12.300">て</span><span begin="1:12.300" end="1:12.560">し</span><span begin="1:12.660" end="1:12.850">ま</span><span begin="1:12.850" end="1:13.010">っ</span><span begin="1:13.010" end="1:13.510">た</span><span begin="1:13.510" end="1:13.690">ん</span><span begin="1:13.690" end="1:14.060">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 我已经察觉到这一点了啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啊 我已經察覺到這一點了啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Ah I have ended up realizing that</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아아, 그것을 깨닫고 말았어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ah je m&apos;en suis enfin rendue compte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ah me he dado cuenta de eso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ah das habe ich nun erkannt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah eu acabei percebendo isso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ах вот что я наконец осознала</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ah me ne sono resa conto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aa sore ni kizuite shimattan da</span></p><p begin="1:16.700" end="1:21.340" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.700" end="1:17.070">眠</span><span begin="1:17.070" end="1:17.240">れ</span><span begin="1:17.240" end="1:17.480">な</span><span begin="1:17.480" end="1:17.560">い</span><span begin="1:17.560" end="1:17.940">夜</span><span begin="1:17.940" end="1:18.350">が</span><span begin="1:18.570" end="1:18.950">誘</span><span begin="1:18.950" end="1:19.120">う</span><span begin="1:19.120" end="1:19.460">迷</span><span begin="1:19.460" end="1:19.810">宮</span><span begin="1:19.810" end="1:20.120">の</span><span begin="1:20.120" end="1:20.490">回</span><span begin="1:20.490" end="1:21.340">路</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法入眠的夜晚所诱导的迷宫回路</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">無法入眠的夜晚所誘導的迷宮迴路</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The labyrinthine circuit invited by sleepless nights</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">잠들지 못하는 밤이 유혹하는 미궁의 회로</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Les nuits blanches m&apos;invitent dans les circuits d&apos;un labyrinthe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El circuito del laberinto al que invitan las noches de insomnio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Der Labyrinth-Schaltkreis in den schlaflose Nächte locken</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O circuito de labirinto que a noite sem dormir convida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Цепь лабиринтов куда манят бессонные ночи</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il circuito labirintico a cui mi invitano le notti insonni</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nemurenai yoru ga sasou meikyuu no kairo</span></p><p begin="1:21.830" end="1:27.230" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.830" end="1:21.980">理</span><span begin="1:21.980" end="1:22.520">想</span><span begin="1:22.520" end="1:22.670">と</span><span begin="1:22.670" end="1:23.020">現</span><span begin="1:23.020" end="1:23.400">実</span><span begin="1:23.400" end="1:23.780">の</span><span begin="1:24.060" end="1:24.200">バ</span><span begin="1:24.200" end="1:24.370">グ</span><span begin="1:24.370" end="1:24.530">の</span><span begin="1:24.530" end="1:24.900">平</span><span begin="1:24.900" end="1:25.230">行</span><span begin="1:25.230" end="1:25.600">線</span><span begin="1:25.600" end="1:25.900">の</span><span begin="1:25.900" end="1:26.270">世</span><span begin="1:26.270" end="1:26.970">界</span><span begin="1:26.970" end="1:27.230">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在理想与现实产生漏洞的平行线世界中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">在理想與現實產生漏洞的平行線世界中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">In a world of parallel lines of bugs between ideal and reality</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이상과 현실의 오류가 빚어낸 평행선의 세계에서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dans un monde de lignes parallèles fait de bugs entre l&apos;idéal et la réalité</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">En un mundo de líneas paralelas de errores entre el ideal y la realidad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">In einer Welt paralleler Linien aus Bugs von Ideal und Realität</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">No mundo de linhas paralelas de um bug entre ideal e realidade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В мире параллельных линий где баги между идеалом и реальностью</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">In un mondo di linee parallele che è un bug tra ideale e realtà</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Risou to genjitsu no bagu no heikousen no sekai de</span></p><p begin="1:27.470" end="1:31.170" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.470" end="1:27.790">愛</span><span begin="1:27.790" end="1:27.970">し</span><span begin="1:27.970" end="1:28.310">方</span><span begin="1:28.310" end="1:28.480">を</span><span begin="1:28.680" end="1:28.860">ご</span><span begin="1:28.860" end="1:29.020">め</span><span begin="1:29.020" end="1:29.180">ん</span><span begin="1:29.180" end="1:29.330">な</span><span begin="1:29.330" end="1:29.560">さ</span><span begin="1:29.560" end="1:29.690">い</span><span begin="1:29.690" end="1:29.840">を</span><span begin="1:30.030" end="1:30.390">忘</span><span begin="1:30.390" end="1:30.530">れ</span><span begin="1:30.530" end="1:30.720">そ</span><span begin="1:30.720" end="1:30.860">う</span><span begin="1:30.860" end="1:31.020">だ</span><span begin="1:31.020" end="1:31.170">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉快要忘记该如何去爱 该如何去道歉了哦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">感覺快要忘記該如何去愛 該如何去道歉了哦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I feel like I will forget how to love and how to apologize</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">사랑하는 법을, 미안하다는 말을 잊어버릴 것 같아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je suis sur le point d&apos;oublier comment aimer et comment demander pardon</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Siento que voy a olvidar cómo amar y cómo pedir perdón</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich scheine fast zu vergessen wie man liebt und wie man sich entschuldigt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sinto que vou esquecer como amar e pedir desculpas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Кажется я забываю как любить и как просить прощения</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mi sembra di dimenticare come si ama e come si chiede scusa</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aishikata o gomennasai o wasuresou da yo</span></p><p begin="1:31.400" end="1:38.930" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.400" end="1:31.570">泣</span><span begin="1:31.570" end="1:31.690">き</span><span begin="1:31.690" end="1:31.870">そ</span><span begin="1:31.870" end="1:31.970">う</span><span begin="1:32.080" end="1:32.280">な</span><span begin="1:32.410" end="1:33.100">時</span><span begin="1:33.100" end="1:33.410">は</span><span begin="1:33.760" end="1:33.880">あ</span><span begin="1:33.940" end="1:34.040">な</span><span begin="1:34.130" end="1:34.420">た</span><span begin="1:34.460" end="1:34.630">の</span><span begin="1:34.630" end="1:35.040">声</span><span begin="1:35.160" end="1:35.470">見</span><span begin="1:35.470" end="1:36.500">失</span><span begin="1:36.500" end="1:36.690">わ</span><span begin="1:36.690" end="1:36.870">ぬ</span><span begin="1:36.870" end="1:37.170">よう</span><span begin="1:37.700" end="1:38.060">祈</span><span begin="1:38.060" end="1:38.200">っ</span><span begin="1:38.200" end="1:38.360">て</span><span begin="1:38.360" end="1:38.470">い</span><span begin="1:38.570" end="1:38.930">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快要哭泣的时候 祈祷着千万不要迷失你的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">快要哭泣的時候 祈禱著千萬不要迷失你的聲音</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">When I was about to cry I prayed not to lose sight of your voice</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">울 것 같을 때는 당신의 목소리를 잃어버리지 않도록 기도했어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Quand j&apos;étais sur le point de pleurer je priais pour ne pas perdre la trace de ta voix</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cuando estaba a punto de llorar rezaba para no perder de vista tu voz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn mir zum Weinen zumute war betete ich deine Stimme nicht zu verlieren</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quando estava prestes a chorar orava para não perder a sua voz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Когда хотелось плакать я молилась лишь бы не потерять твой голос</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quando stavo per piangere pregavo di non perdere di vista la tua voce</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nakisou na toki wa anata no koe miushinawanu you inotte ita</span></p><p begin="1:43.650" end="1:49.030" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.650" end="1:43.820">あ</span><span begin="1:43.820" end="1:43.970">り</span><span begin="1:43.970" end="1:44.330">ふ</span><span begin="1:44.330" end="1:44.510">れ</span><span begin="1:44.510" end="1:44.680">て</span><span begin="1:44.680" end="1:45.010">た</span><span begin="1:45.010" end="1:45.330">日</span><span begin="1:45.330" end="1:45.680">常</span><span begin="1:45.680" end="1:45.850">た</span><span begin="1:45.850" end="1:46.010">ち</span><span begin="1:46.010" end="1:46.170">が</span> <span begin="1:46.410" end="1:46.750">こ</span><span begin="1:46.750" end="1:47.070">ん</span><span begin="1:47.070" end="1:47.260">な</span><span begin="1:47.410" end="1:47.640">に</span><span begin="1:47.750" end="1:48.290">恋</span><span begin="1:48.420" end="1:48.670">し</span><span begin="1:48.810" end="1:49.030">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那些稀松平常的日常 竟是如此惹人依恋</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那些稀鬆平常的日常 竟是如此惹人依戀</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I miss the mundane everyday things so much</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">흔해 빠졌던 일상들이 이렇게나 그리워</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ces jours ordinaires me manquent tellement</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Extraño tanto estos días cotidianos tan comunes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Der einst so alltägliche Alltag fehlt mir so sehr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sinto tanta falta daqueles dias comuns</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я так скучаю по тем обыденным дням</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mi manca così tanto la banale quotidianità</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Arifureteta nichijoutachi ga konna ni koishii</span></p><p begin="1:49.440" end="1:54.570" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:49.440" end="1:49.790">何</span><span begin="1:49.790" end="1:49.930">度</span><span begin="1:49.930" end="1:50.140">で</span><span begin="1:50.140" end="1:50.300">も</span><span begin="1:50.490" end="1:50.580">あ</span><span begin="1:50.630" end="1:50.730">な</span><span begin="1:50.810" end="1:50.960">た</span><span begin="1:50.960" end="1:51.160">が</span><span begin="1:51.160" end="1:51.300">く</span><span begin="1:51.300" end="1:51.490">れ</span><span begin="1:51.490" end="1:51.670">た</span> <span begin="1:51.850" end="1:52.410">美</span><span begin="1:52.510" end="1:52.840">し</span><span begin="1:52.840" end="1:53.210">い</span><span begin="1:53.210" end="1:53.530">ライ</span><span begin="1:53.530" end="1:53.900">フ</span><span begin="1:53.900" end="1:54.230">ラ</span><span begin="1:54.230" end="1:54.570">イン</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论多少次 你所给予我的 那美丽的生命线</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">無論多少次 你所給予我的 那美麗的生命線</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The beautiful lifeline you gave me countless times</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">몇 번이고 당신이 내게 건네준 아름다운 생명선</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La magnifique ligne de vie que tu m&apos;as donnée maintes et maintes fois</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La hermosa línea de vida que me diste una y otra vez</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die wunderschöne Lebenslinie die du mir immer wieder gabst</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A bela tábua de salvação que você me deu tantas vezes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Тот прекрасный спасательный круг что ты бросал мне снова и снова</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La bellissima ancora di salvezza che mi hai dato innumerevoli volte</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nando demo anata ga kureta utsukushii raifurain</span></p><p begin="1:54.910" end="2:01.370" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:54.910" end="1:55.270">何</span><span begin="1:55.270" end="1:55.420">の</span><span begin="1:55.420" end="1:55.600">た</span><span begin="1:55.600" end="1:55.800">め</span><span begin="1:55.800" end="1:55.830">？</span> <span begin="1:55.960" end="1:56.180">二</span><span begin="1:56.290" end="1:56.620">度</span><span begin="1:56.620" end="1:56.790">と</span><span begin="1:56.790" end="1:56.970">な</span><span begin="1:56.970" end="1:57.240">い</span><span begin="1:57.650" end="1:57.980">愛</span><span begin="1:57.980" end="1:58.140">す</span><span begin="1:58.140" end="1:58.340">べ</span><span begin="1:58.340" end="1:58.650">き</span><span begin="1:58.650" end="1:58.840">こ</span><span begin="1:58.840" end="1:59.000">の</span><span begin="1:59.000" end="1:59.320">人</span><span begin="1:59.320" end="1:59.700">生</span><span begin="1:59.700" end="1:59.930">を</span><span begin="2:00.220" end="2:00.890">彩</span><span begin="2:00.890" end="2:01.050">る</span><span begin="2:01.050" end="2:01.370">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是为了什么 为了点缀这绝无仅有值得去爱的人生吗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">是為了什麼 為了點綴這絕無僅有值得去愛的人生嗎</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">For what? To color this lovable life that will never come again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">무엇을 위해? 두 번 다시 없을 사랑해야 할 이 인생을 물들이는 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dans quel but ? Pour colorer cette vie unique et digne d&apos;être aimée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿Para qué? Para colorear esta amada vida que nunca volverá</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wofür? Um dieses unwiederbringliche liebenswerte Leben zu färben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Para que serve? Para colorir esta vida amada que não haverá de novo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ради чего Чтобы раскрасить эту неповторимую жизнь которую стоит любить</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Per cosa coloro questa vita da amare che non tornerà mai più</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nan no tame? nido to nai aisubeki kono jinsei o irodoru no</span></p><p begin="2:01.410" end="2:07.790" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.410" end="2:01.640">わ</span><span begin="2:01.740" end="2:01.990">た</span><span begin="2:02.070" end="2:02.340">し</span><span begin="2:02.450" end="2:02.660">の</span><span begin="2:02.770" end="2:04.280">声</span><span begin="2:04.810" end="2:05.480">響</span><span begin="2:05.480" end="2:05.830">い</span><span begin="2:05.830" end="2:07.790">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我的声音回荡吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">讓我的聲音迴盪吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let my voice echo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내 목소리여 울려 퍼져라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Que ma voix résonne</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Que mi voz resuene</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Möge meine Stimme erklingen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Minha voz ressoa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Пусть мой голос звучит эхом</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Che la mia voce risuoni</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Watashi no koe hibiite</span></p><p begin="2:11.270" end="2:14.280" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:11.270" end="2:11.390">時</span><span begin="2:11.450" end="2:11.820">間</span><span begin="2:11.820" end="2:11.960">の</span><span begin="2:11.960" end="2:12.300">狭</span><span begin="2:12.300" end="2:12.670">間</span><span begin="2:12.670" end="2:12.960">を</span><span begin="2:13.160" end="2:13.550">辿</span><span begin="2:13.550" end="2:13.670">っ</span><span begin="2:13.670" end="2:13.850">た</span><span begin="2:13.850" end="2:13.990">ら</span><span begin="2:13.990" end="2:14.280">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是沿着时间的缝隙追寻而去的话</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">若是沿著時間的縫隙追尋而去的話</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If I trace the interstices of time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">시간의 틈새를 더듬어 가다 보면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si je trace mon chemin à travers les interstices du temps</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si sigo la brecha del tiempo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn ich den Spuren in den Zwischenräumen der Zeit folge</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Se eu traçar pelas lacunas do tempo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Если пройти по расщелинам времени</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se ripercorro le fessure del tempo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Jikan no hazama o tadottara sa</span></p><p begin="2:14.330" end="2:15.620" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:14.330" end="2:14.580">待</span><span begin="2:14.580" end="2:14.690">っ</span><span begin="2:14.690" end="2:14.840">て</span><span begin="2:14.840" end="2:15.030">い</span><span begin="2:15.030" end="2:15.180">て</span><span begin="2:15.180" end="2:15.620">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请等等我啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">請等等我啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Wait for me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">기다려 줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Attends-moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Espérame</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Warte auf mich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Espere</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Подожди же</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Aspetta</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Matte ite yo</span></p><p begin="2:15.870" end="2:18.360" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:15.870" end="2:16.230">与</span><span begin="2:16.230" end="2:16.400">え</span><span begin="2:16.400" end="2:16.570">ら</span><span begin="2:16.570" end="2:16.740">れ</span><span begin="2:16.740" end="2:16.960">た</span><span begin="2:17.260" end="2:17.610">役</span><span begin="2:17.610" end="2:17.760">目</span><span begin="2:17.760" end="2:17.940">だ</span><span begin="2:17.940" end="2:18.110">け</span><span begin="2:18.110" end="2:18.360">じゃ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果仅仅是扮演被赋予的角色</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">如果僅僅是扮演被賦予的角色</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Just with the role I was given</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">주어진 역할만으로는</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Rien qu&apos;avec le rôle qui m&apos;a été confié</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Solo con el papel que me fue asignado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nur mit der Rolle die mir gegeben wurde</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Apenas com o papel que me foi dado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Одной лишь отведенной мне роли</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Solo con il ruolo che mi è stato assegnato</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ataerareta yakume dake ja</span></p><p begin="2:18.610" end="2:22.100" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:18.610" end="2:18.700">わ</span><span begin="2:18.770" end="2:19.050">た</span><span begin="2:19.090" end="2:19.250">し</span><span begin="2:19.280" end="2:19.450">で</span><span begin="2:19.450" end="2:19.800">い</span><span begin="2:19.800" end="2:20.150">ら</span><span begin="2:20.150" end="2:20.460">れ</span><span begin="2:20.460" end="2:20.800">な</span><span begin="2:20.800" end="2:21.130">い</span><span begin="2:21.130" end="2:21.400">背</span><span begin="2:21.500" end="2:21.830">伸</span><span begin="2:21.830" end="2:22.100">び</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">逞强着只会让我无法做真正的自己</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">逞強著只會讓我無法做真正的自己</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Stretching myself unable to remain myself</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나로 있을 수 없어서 발돋움을 해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je m&apos;étire car je ne peux pas rester moi-même</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Es un sobreesfuerzo con el que no puedo ser yo misma</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Kann ich nicht ich selbst bleiben dieses Strecken</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">É um esforço excessivo onde não posso ser eu mesma</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Недостаточно чтобы быть собой я тянусь на цыпочках</span><span tt