&apos;en revêts c&apos;est bien solitaire n&apos;est-ce pas ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Con eso llamado rectitud es solitario verdad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sogenannte Richtigkeit kleidet ist es doch einsam nicht wahr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Como a retidão também é solitário não é</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В так называемую правильность всё равно ведь одиноко</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Di ciò che è giusto non mi sento forse sola</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kikonde mo sabishii ja nai ka</span></p><p begin="2:48.580" end="2:52.950" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:48.580" end="2:48.680">わ</span><span begin="2:48.760" end="2:49.030">た</span><span begin="2:49.080" end="2:49.210">し</span><span begin="2:49.270" end="2:49.450">と</span><span begin="2:49.450" end="2:49.770">あ</span><span begin="2:49.820" end="2:50.040">な</span><span begin="2:50.120" end="2:50.410">た</span><span begin="2:50.480" end="2:50.810">の</span><span begin="2:50.810" end="2:51.180">た</span><span begin="2:51.180" end="2:51.390">め</span><span begin="2:51.500" end="2:51.850">に</span><span begin="2:51.850" end="2:52.880">歌</span><span begin="2:52.880" end="2:52.950">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是为了我和你而歌唱</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我是為了我和你而歌唱</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I sing for the sake of myself and you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나와 당신을 위해 노래해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je chante pour toi et moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Yo canto para mí y para ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich singe für mich und für dich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu canto por mim e por você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я буду петь ради себя и ради тебя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Io canto per me e per te</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Watashi to anata no tame ni utau</span></p><p begin="2:53.370" end="2:57.710" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:53.370" end="2:53.870">あ</span><span begin="2:53.870" end="2:54.220">ぁ</span><span begin="2:54.220" end="2:54.430">そ</span><span begin="2:54.430" end="2:54.580">れ</span><span begin="2:54.580" end="2:54.750">に</span><span begin="2:54.750" end="2:54.900">気</span><span begin="2:54.900" end="2:55.240">づ</span><span begin="2:55.240" end="2:55.460">い</span><span begin="2:55.570" end="2:55.890">て</span><span begin="2:55.890" end="2:56.260">し</span><span begin="2:56.260" end="2:56.510">ま</span><span begin="2:56.510" end="2:56.610">っ</span><span begin="2:56.610" end="2:57.180">た</span><span begin="2:57.180" end="2:57.330">ん</span><span begin="2:57.330" end="2:57.710">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 我已经察觉到这一点了啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啊 我已經察覺到這一點了啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Ah I have ended up realizing that</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아아, 그것을 깨닫고 말았어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ah je m&apos;en suis enfin rendue compte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ah me he dado cuenta de eso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ah das habe ich nun erkannt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah eu acabei percebendo isso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ах вот что я наконец осознала</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ah me ne sono resa conto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aa sore ni kizuite shimattan da</span></p><p begin="2:58.820" end="3:03.150" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:58.820" end="2:59.240">な</span><span begin="2:59.240" end="2:59.640">ぁ</span><span begin="2:59.640" end="2:59.850">そ</span><span begin="2:59.850" end="3:00.000">れ</span><span begin="3:00.000" end="3:00.130">が</span><span begin="3:00.170" end="3:00.280">わ</span><span begin="3:00.360" end="3:00.590">た</span><span begin="3:00.700" end="3:00.910">し</span><span begin="3:01.050" end="3:01.270">の</span><span begin="3:01.380" end="3:01.600">た</span><span begin="3:01.730" end="3:02.080">め</span><span begin="3:02.080" end="3:02.420">の</span><span begin="3:02.420" end="3:03.150">歌</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 那正是为了我而存在的歌</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">吶 那正是為了我而存在的歌</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Say that is the song for me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래, 그것이 나를 위한 노래야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dis c&apos;est ça la chanson qui m&apos;est destinée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Oye esa es la canción para mí</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Weißt du das ist das Lied für mich selbst</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sabe essa é a canção para mim mesma</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Знаешь ведь это и есть песня для меня</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sai questa è una canzone per me stessa</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Naa sore ga watashi no tame no uta</span></p></div></body></tt>